        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, koikoi angani ajua nyakati zake zilizoamriwa; na hua na mbayuwayu na korongo huangalia wakati wa kuja kwao; bali watu wangu hawazijui amri za BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.7"
            ]
