        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, kwa hiyo nitawapa watu wengine wake zao na mashamba yao nitawapa wale watakaowamiliki; maana kila mmoja wao, tangu aliye mdogo hata aliye mkubwa, ni mtamanifu; tangu nabii hata kuhani, kila mmoja hutenda mambo ya udanganyifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
